  "body": "Combining a beautifully appointed main residence with a private, self-contained minor dwelling, this property brings together quality, thoughtful detail and plenty of appeal. It offers a rare blend of premium family living, flexibility and exciting income potential.\r\n\r\nThe Main Residence\r\n*\tDesigner kitchen featuring premium Fisher & Paykel appliances and stylish Australian tiles\r\n*\tThree spacious bedrooms plus a dedicated study\r\n*\t2.5 bathrooms, including a master ensuite. Underfloor heating and Italian & Spanish tiles.\r\n*\tOpen-plan living and dining flowing seamlessly onto an outdoor deck and landscaped garden\r\n*\tCentral heating for year-round comfort\r\n*\tOversized double garage with polished concrete flooring\r\n\r\nThe Minor Dwelling\r\n*\tPrivate entrance with a fully self-contained living environment\r\n*\tSpacious, light-filled open-plan living area\r\n*\tStylish, well-designed kitchen with a dedicated laundry area\r\n*\tTwo generous double bedrooms with one bathroom\r\n*\tPrivate decks and outdoor spaces for relaxation\r\n*\tHigh-quality finishes offering comfort, style and practicality\r\n\r\nTwo homes, one title, featuring separate water meters, electricity, and gas meters. Each living space enjoys complete independence and privacy. Ideal for rental income, Airbnb hosting, or extended families seeking separate arrangements under one roof. \r\n\r\nSet in sought-after Red Beach, this is more than just a beautiful place to call home. It's an opportunity to enjoy a premium coastal lifestyle while keeping your options open for the future. Come and discover the sweet life and call us to view!",
